<!-- The launch frame (S4, owner decision 8): the app's ground, #0b0d12, with
     the brand mark centred at 96 pt. Not the stock Capacitor splash, and not
     systemBackgroundColor, which is white in light mode and flashed on every
     cold start. The ground is the colour capacitor.config.ts gives the web
     view, so icon, launch frame and first paint are one dark field. -->
